WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.300
Lab 2 runs it against a test tenant, never
production; the authors haven't run it.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.285
Register a reader app with a
certificate or federated credential,

3
00:00:09.285 --> 00:00:12.400
and grant only the two
permissions the export lists.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.863
Run Chapters 1 through 6 against the
test tenant and keep their folders.

5
00:00:16.863 --> 00:00:20.200
Write a run in tenant mode
and read every finding.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.479
Schedule it in Book 19's workflow
with no secret, writing packages

7
00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:29.075
to an immutable container outside
the directory, each naming the last.

8
00:00:29.075 --> 00:00:32.575
After a few runs, check that
a skipped day shows as a gap.

9
00:00:32.575 --> 00:00:33.840
Then back it all out.
